										<div class="ed-meta-wrap">
											<div class="ed-author"><span class="byline"> By <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://bergen.edu/posts/author/lhlavenkabergen-cc-nj-us/">Lawrence Hlavenka</a></span></span></div><div class="ed-date"><span class="posted-on">On <a href="https://bergen.edu/posts/she-loves-me-continues-bergenstages-season/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-11-17T11:14:42-05:00">November 17, 2026</time><time class="updated" datetime="2026-11-17T09:16:05-05:00">November 17, 2026</time></a></span></div>										</div>

										<div class="ed-content-wrap">
											<div class="ed-content">
												<p>Lila Bell as Amalia Balash and Justin Larghi as Georg Nowack. PARAMUS, N.J. – The Bergen Institute for&#8230;</p>
