										</div>

										<div class="ed-title">
											<h3><a href="https://bergen.edu/posts/bergen-honors-students-earn-scholarships/">Bergen Honors Students Earn Scholarships</a></h3>	
										</div>

										<div class="ed-meta-wrap">
											<div class="ed-author"><span class="byline"> By <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://bergen.edu/posts/author/lhlavenkabergen-cc-nj-us/">Lawrence Hlavenka</a></span></span></div><div class="ed-date"><span class="posted-on">On <a href="https://bergen.edu/posts/bergen-honors-students-earn-scholarships/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-10-14T11:41:21-04:00">October 14, 2026</time><time class="updated" datetime="2026-10-08T11:42:29-04:00">October 8, 2026</time></a></span></div>										</div>

										<div class="ed-content-wrap">
											<div class="ed-content">
												<p>TianaMarie Allen and Donia Eid. PARAMUS, N.J. – Two Bergen Community College students have started the new academic&#8230;</p>
												<a href="https://bergen.edu/posts/bergen-honors-students-earn-scholarships/" class="ed-button">
													read more												</a>
											</div>
										</div>

										<div class="ed-bottom-wrap">
											<div class="ed-tag">
																							</div>
										</div>

									</div>
								</div>

							
								<div class="ed-blog-col">
									<div class="ed-blog-img">
										<a href="https://bergen.edu/posts/bergenstages-gives-audiences-a-red-herring/">
											<img src="https://bergen.edu/wp-content/uploads/RedHerring-400x290.jpeg" alt="Bergenstages Gives Audiences a “Red Herring”">
										</a>
									</div>

									<div class="ed-desc-wrap">

										<div class="ed-category-list">
											<a href="https://bergen.edu/posts/category/news/" rel="category tag">News</a>, <a href="https://bergen.edu/posts/category/news/spotlight/" rel="category tag">Spotlight</a> 
										</div>

										<div class="ed-title">
											<h3><a href="https://bergen.edu/posts/bergenstages-gives-audiences-a-red-herring/">Bergenstages Gives Audiences a “Red Herring”</a></h3>	
										</div>

										<div class="ed-meta-wrap">
											<div class="ed-author"><span class="byline"> By <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://bergen.edu/posts/author/lhlavenkabergen-cc-nj-us/">Lawrence Hlavenka</a></span></span></div><div class="ed-date"><span class="posted-on">On <a href="https://bergen.edu/posts/bergenstages-gives-audiences-a-red-herring/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-10-08T11:19:09-04:00">October 8, 2026</time></a></span></div>										</div>

										<div class="ed-content-wrap">
